    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what does \"reshaping it\" even mean? it feels like trying to fight gravity. every time i think i'm doing okay, i see something in myself that reminds me of them. like i'm just a carbon copy of a tragedy. it's like my DNA has already decided how this story ends, and i'm just watching the countdown.",
